{
  "name": "MushroomProcess - Clover Sandbox Test",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Clover Sandbox setup \u2014 app X428N4RYRG5S8\n1. Create a Custom Auth credential named **Clover Sandbox Token Exchange** with this JSON, replacing both placeholders privately:\n`{\"body\":{\"client_secret\":\"YOUR_SANDBOX_APP_SECRET\",\"code\":\"YOUR_AUTHORIZATION_CODE\"}}`\nSelect it in **HTTP - Exchange Sandbox Authorization Code**. The node sends JSON, fixing the generic OAuth2 credential's 415 error. The authorization code comes from the `code` query parameter in your failed OAuth callback window. Obtain a fresh code through that OAuth flow if it expires. The code exchange runs once per authorization. A successful exchange returns sensitive access/refresh tokens; complete credential setup before recording a video.\n2. In **Sandbox Settings**, select `operation: 'exchange'`, then Execute Workflow. Copy `access_token` into a new **Bearer Auth** credential named **Clover Sandbox Pay Display Token**. Select that same credential in the merchant, ping, payment, order-types and create-order HTTP nodes. Paste only the token, with no Bearer prefix. Credentials remain in n8n.\n3. Enter your sandbox test merchant ID in **Sandbox Settings**, choose `operation: 'merchant'`, and Execute Workflow. A successful read verifies sandbox authentication without a device.\n4. For device tests, enter the sandbox app RAID and the serial of a sandbox-associated Dev Kit. Open Cloud Pay Display on that device. Choose `ping` and expect `connected: true`. Your live merchant Flex remains a production device; a sandbox URL alone does not make it a sandbox target.\n5. Choose `payment` and enter one UUID as paymentAttemptId. Execute Workflow to request $1.00. Cancel on the device to test the prompt alone. Keep the SAME paymentAttemptId for retries, and query the payment by external reference after an ambiguous result. Use a new UUID only for a new payment. externalPaymentId is derived from that UUID, keeping both references together.\n6. For renewal, create a separate Custom Auth credential **Clover Sandbox Token Refresh** with `{\"body\":{\"refresh_token\":\"YOUR_CURRENT_REFRESH_TOKEN\"}}` and select it in **HTTP - Refresh Sandbox Token**. Choose `refresh`; update the Bearer Auth credential and stored refresh token from the response. Refresh is manual in this test workflow.\nOptional: `order_types` and `create_order` retain the original order experiment against sandbox. These require corresponding Orders permissions beyond Merchant Read. For order creation, fill sandboxOrderTypeId.\nAll API URLs target apisandbox.dev.clover.com. This workflow has no fallback to production credentials. Live sandbox execution and Clover review acceptance remain pending.",
        "height": 1040,
        "width": 840
      },
      "id": "050219c5-7454-40e9-aeb0-26a0e723d366",
      "name": "Sandbox Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        -720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "7f0ffecb-4509-47a2-a701-d3a5116c2de2",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        96,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Select one operation, then click Execute Workflow.\n// exchange | refresh | merchant | ping | payment | order_types | create_order\nconst settings = {\n  operation: 'exchange',\n  sandboxAppId: 'X428N4RYRG5S8',\n  sandboxMerchantId: '',\n  sandboxRemoteAppId: '',\n  sandboxDeviceSerial: '',\n  paymentAttemptId: '', // A UUID. Reuse for a retry, replace for a NEW payment.\n  sandboxOrderTypeId: '', // Optional original atomic-order experiment.\n};\n\nconst operations = ['exchange', 'refresh', 'merchant', 'ping', 'payment', 'order_types', 'create_order'];\nif (!operations.includes(settings.operation)) {\n  throw new Error('Choose a supported operation listed above the settings.');\n}\nconst merchantOperations = ['merchant', 'order_types', 'create_order'];\nif (merchantOperations.includes(settings.operation) && !/^[A-Z0-9]{13}$/.test(settings.sandboxMerchantId)) {\n  throw new Error('Enter the 13-character SANDBOX test merchant ID in Sandbox Settings.');\n}\nif (['ping', 'payment'].includes(settings.operation)) {\n  if (!settings.sandboxRemoteAppId.trim() || !/^[A-Z0-9]{14}$/.test(settings.sandboxDeviceSerial)) {\n    throw new Error('Enter the sandbox app RAID and sandbox Dev Kit serial in Sandbox Settings.');\n  }\n}\nif (settings.operation === 'payment' && !/^[0-9a-f]{8}(?:-[0-9a-f]{4}){3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i.test(settings.paymentAttemptId)) {\n  throw new Error('Enter a UUID as paymentAttemptId. Keep it for retries of the same payment.');\n}\nif (settings.operation === 'create_order' && !/^[A-Z0-9]{13}$/.test(settings.sandboxOrderTypeId)) {\n  throw new Error('Enter an enabled SANDBOX order type ID before creating an order.');\n}\nreturn [{ json: settings }];"
      },
